    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nDennehy Auctioneers are delighted to offer spacious, four/five bedroom, semi-detached residence, with the benefit of unusually large front and rear gardens  (circa .073 Hectare (0.18 acre)) providing exceptional potential for extension, or the possibility of construction of a mews house. Idyllic location in quiet  cul-de-sac in the highly sought after Gardiners Hill area, just 1 km north of Cork City Centre. Enjoying a prime location close to an excellent range of amenities including restaurants, bars, cafés, shops, schools, and public transport links, this property offers the perfect balance of city convenience, residential charm in an exceptionally tranquil setting. Extending over generous living accommodation, the residence presents an exciting opportunity for purchasers to modernize and redesign to their own taste and requirements. This is a rare opportunity indeed to acquire a home with such  enormous potential in one of Cork City's most desirable and established residential locations.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of Front Porch, Hallway, Sitting Room, Family Room, Kitchen, Utility, Five Bedrooms, Bathroom and Double Garage (4.5m x5.5m attached to rear of residence and can be easily converted to addition accommodation).\r\n\r\nServices:\r\n\r\nMains water, mains sewer, natural gas central heating (combi-boiler)."
      },
      {
